  "rules": [
    "Each faction has at most one authoritative facility of each registered building type at a site. Expansion enlarges that same facility; it does not spawn duplicate differently-levelled facilities.",
    "Building level is quality only. Mutable infrastructure state owns estate land, facility footprint and physical capacity.",
    "An upgrade consumes exact cash, registered material lots and labor hours and cannot complete before minimum_calendar_days.",
    "An expansion consumes estate land, exact materials, exact labor and time. Costs scale deterministically with added footprint and current construction quality.",
    "Building condition is tracked separately from level; damage never silently lowers or raises the saved level.",
    "All factions use the same quality and expansion formulas."
  ],
